│ patch_description        │ This version crosses over the stronger parts of both prior implementations while          │
│                          │ targeting the main failure mode: slope collapse in validation caused by regime-specific   │
│                          │ features.                                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key changes:                                                                              │
│                          │ - Uses shorter, more regime-robust lookbacks overall (5–20 bars emphasized, with only a   │
│                          │ few medium windows).                                                                      │
│                          │ - Adds rolling z-score normalization and rolling rank features to make signals more       │
│                          │ regime-invariant.                                                                         │
│                          │ - Introduces explicit rate-of-change regime features such as volatility trend,            │
│                          │ autocorrelation trend, and efficiency trend.                                              │
│                          │ - Keeps a compact feature set well under the 80-feature limit while preserving useful     │
│                          │ interactions like momentum × volatility regime.                                           │
│                          │ - Tightens model regularization relative to the overfit-prone current version, but not so │
│                          │ much that prediction variance collapses further.                                          │
│                          │ - Uses a slightly lower learning rate and a moderate number of trees to improve           │
│                          │ generalization across the second regime shift.                                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The implementation preserves the same inputs, outputs, and execution flow, while          │
│                          │ improving the internal feature engineering and XGBoost configuration.                     │
