│                          │ shorter-horizon, regime-normalized signals and slightly stronger tree regularization.     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key ideas:                                                                                │
│                          │ - Replace several long-lookback constructs with shorter, more reactive windows that       │
│                          │ should survive regime shifts better.                                                      │
│                          │ - Add rolling z-score / normalization features so the same market move is measured        │
│                          │ relative to its recent local context.                                                     │
│                          │ - Add rate-of-change features for volatility, efficiency, and autocorrelation proxies,    │
│                          │ which are often more stable across changing volatility regimes than absolute levels.      │
│                          │ - Add a compact momentum × volatility-regime interaction to preserve the useful           │
│                          │ interaction signal, but in a more regime-invariant form.                                  │
│                          │ - Strengthen XGBoost regularization a bit and reduce tree count so the model is less able │
│                          │ to memorize the training regime, while still retaining enough capacity to learn robust    │
│                          │ patterns.                                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The changes are designed to improve validation slope and prediction dispersion without    │
│                          │ increasing feature count beyond the allowed limit.                                        │
