│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ robust_short_regime_features                                                              │
│ patch_description        │ This edit focuses on the main failure mode: the model’s slope collapses on the validation │
│                          │ regime because it is relying on absolute-level signals that do not survive a second       │
│                          │ regime shift. I keep the model compact enough to generalize, but add more                 │
│                          │ regime-invariant, short-horizon features:                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ - rolling z-scores for returns, momentum, price displacement, and volume                  │
│                          │ - short-window volatility with explicit volatility trend / acceleration                   │
│                          │ - efficiency-ratio trend to detect changing market character                              │
│                          │ - short autocorrelation features and their trend                                          │
│                          │ - interaction terms that combine normalized momentum with volatility regime               │
│                          │ - shorter lookbacks overall to reduce regime decay                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ I also slightly soften the model so it can use these new features without overfitting to  │
│                          │ long-lived training quirks. The goal is to lift validation slope and prediction           │
│                          │ dispersion while preserving directional accuracy.                                         │
