│                          │ - Keeps only robust interactions like momentum × volatility regime and volume × price     │
│                          │ pressure.                                                                                 │
│                          │ - Uses a slightly less constrained XGBoost setup to avoid mean-collapse while still       │
│                          │ controlling overfit.                                                                      │
│                          │ - Keeps feature count comfortably below the 80-feature limit and uses only past data.     │
